      "word": "antenna",
      "article": "",
      "phonetic": "/ænˈtenə/",
      "translation": "anténa",
      "definition": "A device used to send or receive radio, television, or other electromagnetic signals.",
      "type": "noun",
      "level": "B1",
      "example_en": "The engineer adjusted the antenna to improve the signal in the communication system.",
      "example_sk": "Inžinier nastavil anténu, aby zlepšil signál v komunikačnom systéme.",
      "topic": "engineering",
      "source": "Elektrotechnika IV - Radio-Frequency Engineering, "
    },
    {
